# Re-aimed (sessions-merge): `ai.dashboard` opens the sessions table.
# The header carries the table's chips — the sort chip, `ended:` and
# `? help` — and the filter pill narrows the rows; a filter that
# matches nothing says so, and Esc clears it.
#
# History: verified the dashboard's "· paused (filter)" title chip
# (54301a9 / ef66d8e). The table pauses its tail while the pill has
# the keys too, but says nothing in the title — `p` is the pause.

write placeholder.txt x
open placeholder.txt

command ai.dashboard
expect screen contains "SESSIONS"
expect screen contains "sort:"
expect screen contains "ended: hidden"
expect screen contains "? help"

# The filter pill takes the keys; nothing matches; Esc clears.
key /
type zzzz
expect screen contains "󰍉 zzzz"
key esc
expect screen lacks "󰍉 zzzz"
